WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:08.300
Double-click a paper — it opens where you left off

2
00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:14.500
Turn on the Highlight tool

3
00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:18.600
Drag across a sentence — marked at once

4
00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:22.100
Click the mark for its color and a note

5
00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:25.600
Pick a color

6
00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:32.200
…and write why it matters

7
00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:35.700
Add to Canvas puts it on a project canvas

8
00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:38.700
…as a quote card that keeps its page

9
00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:42.600
The Note tool sticks a note on the page

10
00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:46.900
Type it

11
00:00:46.900 --> 00:00:51.200
Search the paper (⌘F)

12
00:00:51.200 --> 00:01:01.700
Highlights and Notes: every mark in one place
